<title>ITALY: Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>ITALY, Dec 10 - Genoa - 3 Vessels (2 bulk carriers and one general cargo) waiting for berth. Average berthing delay one to two days.</p>
<p>Savona - No vessels waiting for normal berth, two vessels waiting for special berth.</p>
</text>
